le value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those 75 years. On that same middle, October to November ran 36% in 2025 and September to October ran 35% in 2025, and March to April 2026 came in at 17%. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, and grid 14892 was lowest at 55% in 1954.</p>"}
